=== register-basic
--- args
register
Assets
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
2024-01-01 * opening
    Assets:Bank   1000.00 EUR
    Assets:Cash     50 EUR
    Equity
2024-01-05 * food
    Expenses:Food   12.5 EUR
    Assets:Cash
2024-01-06 * withdraw
    Assets:Cash    100 EUR
    Assets:Bank
--- out
2024-01-01 Assets:Bank 1000.00 EUR 1000.00 EUR
2024-01-01 Assets:Cash 50.00 EUR 1050.00 EUR
2024-01-05 Assets:Cash -12.50 EUR 1037.50 EUR
2024-01-06 Assets:Cash 100.00 EUR 1137.50 EUR
2024-01-06 Assets:Bank -100.00 EUR 1037.50 EUR
=== register-date-order
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-03-01 third
    A  3 EUR
    B
2024-01-01 first
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-02-01 second
    A  2 EUR
    B
--- out
2024-01-01 A 1 EUR 1 EUR
2024-02-01 A 2 EUR 3 EUR
2024-03-01 A 3 EUR 6 EUR
=== register-same-day-file-order
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-05 day five, first in file
    A  1 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 day four
    A  10 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 day five, second in file
    A  2 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 day five, third in file
    A  3 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 day four again
    A  20 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 day five, fourth
    A  4 EUR
    B
--- out
2024-01-04 A 10 EUR 10 EUR
2024-01-04 A 20 EUR 30 EUR
2024-01-05 A 1 EUR 31 EUR
2024-01-05 A 2 EUR 33 EUR
2024-01-05 A 3 EUR 36 EUR
2024-01-05 A 4 EUR 40 EUR
=== register-same-txn-order
--- args
register
Assets
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Z
2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 two matches in one transaction keep file order
    Assets:Z  1 EUR
    B        -3 EUR
    Assets:A  2 EUR
--- out
2024-01-02 Assets:Z 1 EUR 1 EUR
2024-01-02 Assets:A 2 EUR 3 EUR
=== register-segment-prefix
--- args
register
Assets
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Assets-Old
2024-01-01 open AssetsX
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 only Assets and Assets:Cash match
    Assets       1 EUR
    Assets:Cash  2 EUR
    Assets-Old   4 EUR
    AssetsX      8 EUR
    B
--- out
2024-01-02 Assets 1 EUR 1 EUR
2024-01-02 Assets:Cash 2 EUR 3 EUR
=== register-leaf
--- args
register
Assets:Cash
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash:Coins
2024-01-01 open Assets:CashBox
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 leaf and below
    Assets:Cash        1 EUR
    Assets:Cash:Coins  2 EUR
    Assets:CashBox     4 EUR
    B
--- out
2024-01-02 Assets:Cash 1 EUR 1 EUR
2024-01-02 Assets:Cash:Coins 2 EUR 3 EUR
=== register-multi-commodity-totals
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 eur
    A  1.5 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 usd
    A  2 USD
    B
2024-01-04 eur again
    A  -0.5 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 usd again
    A  -2 USD
    B
--- out
2024-01-02 A 1.5 EUR 1.5 EUR
2024-01-03 A 2 USD 2 USD
2024-01-04 A -0.5 EUR 1.0 EUR
2024-01-05 A -2 USD 0 USD
=== register-elided-multi
--- args
register
B
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 elided gets two amounts, in commodity order
    A  1 USD
    A  2 EUR
    A  3 CHF
    B
--- out
2024-01-02 B -3 CHF -3 CHF
2024-01-02 B -2 EUR -2 EUR
2024-01-02 B -1 USD -1 USD
=== register-elided-nothing
--- args
register
C
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-01 open C
2024-01-02 C receives nothing
    A  1 EUR
    B  -1 EUR
    C
2024-01-03 C receives something
    A  1 EUR
    C
--- out
2024-01-03 C -1 EUR -1 EUR
=== register-no-match
--- args
register
Nothing
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 t
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
=== register-total-crosses-zero
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 up
    A  0.25 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 down to zero
    A  -0.25 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 below zero
    A  -1 EUR
    B
--- out
2024-01-02 A 0.25 EUR 0.25 EUR
2024-01-03 A -0.25 EUR 0.00 EUR
2024-01-04 A -1.00 EUR -1.00 EUR
=== register-errors
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-02 bad
    A  1 EUR
    B
    C
--- out
2: MULTI_ELIDED
=== register-scale-from-other-postings
--- args
register
A
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 B writes three decimals
    A  1 EUR
    B  -1.000 EUR
--- out
2024-01-02 A 1.000 EUR 1.000 EUR
=== usage-register-no-prefix
--- args
register
--- in
--- out
USAGE
